            "review_title": "Review at Bún Chả 145",
            "review_text": "Lady W\n134 contributions\n0\nBún Chả 145\nJan 2025 • Solo\nBuncha 145 in Vietnam offers a delicious and authentic experience for those craving traditional Vietnamese dishes. The signature bun cha, with its tender grilled pork, flavorful broth, and fresh herbs, is a standout. The atmosphere is casual and welcoming, perfect for a quick and satisfying meal. The service is friendly and efficient, making it a great spot for anyone looking to enjoy a tasty, no-frills Vietnamese meal. Highly recommended for both locals and tourists!\nRead more\nWritten January 22, 2025",
