            "review_title": "Review at Bún Chả 145",
            "review_text": "Jopie Jusuf\nJakarta, Indonesia48 contributions\n0\nA tiny restaurant we don’t want to miss in Ho Chi Minh City , Vietnam\nDec 2024 • Family\nThis is a tiny restaurant located at the famous Bun Vien walking street. It only offers one menu: Bun Cha…well…and some side dishes such as spring rolls. However, the Bun Cha is sooooo delicious. It is simple, authentic, no fancy local food. It just delicious. Period!\n\nDon’t miss this place, that’s all we can say to other visitors.\nRead more\nWritten December 20, 2024",
